{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16771","headline":"游烂柯山四首 二 · 李幼卿","name":"游烂柯山四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨石何崔嵬，横桥架山顶。\n傍通日月过，仰望虹霓迥。\n圣者开津梁，谁能度兹岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李幼卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}